<article class="article-copy"><p class="policy-date">Effective October 15, 2026</p><h2>Before your recharge is completed</h2><p>Email <?=e(setting('support_email','info@mitechwireless.com'))?> as soon as possible with your order ID and checkout email to request cancellation or correction. A request is not a confirmed cancellation; we must check whether fulfillment has already taken place.</p><h2>If we cannot fulfill your order</h2><p>If you have paid and we cannot provide the ordered refill, contact us to arrange a refund to your original payment method. A payment that failed or was never captured does not require a refund, though your bank may temporarily show an authorization.</p><h2>Completed recharges</h2><p>Prepaid credit already delivered to a mobile account generally cannot be reversed, moved, or exchanged. Check your number and carrier before paying. If you believe we made a fulfillment error, send the order details so we can investigate with the carrier. Applicable consumer rights remain unaffected.</p><h2>Refund timing</h2><p>Once approved, refunds are submitted through Stripe to the original payment method. The time for the credit to appear depends on your bank or card issuer. A refund is shown as completed only after the processor confirms it.</p><h2>Need help?</h2><p>Use <a href="/track">order tracking</a> to check the payment and recharge statuses, or <a href="/contact">contact our team</a>. Never send card numbers or security codes by email.</p></article>
